{'symbol': 'TJX', 'date': '2023-06-06 14:20:00', 'title': 'THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "FRAMINGHAM, MASS.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. (NYSE: TJX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE DECLARATION OF A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $.3325 PER SHARE PAYABLE AUGUST 31, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON AUGUST 10, 2023. ABOUT THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. THE TJX COMPANIES, INC. IS THE LEADING OFF-PRICE RETAILER OF APPAREL AND HOME FASHIONS IN THE U.S. AND WORLDWIDE. AS OF APRIL 29, 2023, THE END OF THE COMPANY'S FIRST QUARTER, THE COMPANY OPERATED A TOTAL OF 4,865 STORES IN NINE C."}